      "filename": "NASA to Test Solution for Radiation-Tolerant Computing in Space (FPGA Board Rev4 10-18-2021).jpg",
      "title": "File:NASA to Test Solution for Radiation-Tolerant Computing in Space (FPGA Board Rev4 10-18-2021).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/NASA_to_Test_Solution_for_Radiation-Tolerant_Computing_in_Space_%28FPGA_Board_Rev4_10-18-2021%29.jpg",
